# ── General, repo-wide rules ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Language/framework-specific rules live in auth-service/.gitignore and
# BookNest/backend/.gitignore; this file covers everything shared across
# the whole backend monorepo (env files, Docker, IDE, OS clutter, etc.).

### Environment & secrets ###

.env
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
!**/src/**/*.key

### Docker ###
docker-compose.override.yml
.docker/
*.pid

### Logs (any service, any location) ###
*.log
*.log.gz
logs/

### IDE ###
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr

### OS clutter ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

### Editor backups/swap files ###
*~
*.swp
*.swo

### Archives accidentally left in the repo ###
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar

### Combined image build context leftovers ###
combined/*.log

### Build artifacts and release packages (source archives, Docker images, and checksums)
release-assets/
